The Seller may terminate by giving [15] days’ electronic notice, subject to completion of accepted Orders, returns, complaints, and outstanding obligations.

### 30.3 Hastabazaar Termination Without Cause

Hastabazaar may terminate without cause on [30] days’ notice.

### 30.4 Termination for Cause

Either Party may terminate for a material breach not cured within [7] days after notice where cure is possible. Hastabazaar may terminate immediately for fraud, counterfeit or illegal Products, deliberate safety concealment, repeated authenticity violation, serious data misuse, loss of legal eligibility, or another incurable serious breach.

### 30.5 Effect

Upon termination, new listings and Orders cease, but the Parties shall complete or lawfully cancel existing Orders, returns, refunds, settlements, complaints, recalls, and regulatory cooperation. Hastabazaar shall pay undisputed amounts subject to authorized reserves and deductions.

### 30.6 Survival

Clauses concerning accrued payment, returns, warranties, records, confidentiality, data use, intellectual property, indemnity, liability, disputes, and other provisions intended by nature to continue shall survive termination.

