Subject to mandatory jurisdiction rules, unresolved disputes between Hastabazaar and the Seller shall be submitted to the competent courts of Nepal located in [KATHMANDU DISTRICT/OTHER AGREED LOCATION]. The forum must be commercially and legally approved before execution.

