The Seller may not assign this Agreement without Hastabazaar’s prior written consent, not to be unreasonably withheld. Hastabazaar may assign it in connection with a lawful merger, reorganization, or transfer of the marketplace business after notice, provided the assignee assumes Hastabazaar’s obligations.

